          "type": "String&"
        },
        {
          "name": "Template Asset Path",
          "type": "String&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "Close the current Persistent Level (without saving it). Create a new Level base on another level and save it. Load the new created level.\n@param\tAssetPath\t\t\t\tAsset Path of where the level will be saved.\nie. /Game/MyFolder/MyAsset\n@param\tTemplateAssetPath\t\tLevel to be used as Template.\nie. /Game/MyFolder/MyAsset\n@return\tTrue if the operation succeeds."
